flowchart TD
  A([You: I am confused]) --> B[Tell: write it in your own words]
  B --> C{Diagnose: which kind?}
  C -->|facts| T[What is true?]
  C -->|feelings| W[What do I want?]
  C -->|choices| D[What should I do?]
  C -->|identity| S[Who am I?]
  C -->|future| P[Where am I going?]
  T & W & D & S & P --> Z[Size it: disk tree of the problem]
  Z --> M[Method workbench]
  M --> N[Next step and review date]
  N --> R{Review: clearer?}
  R -->|yes| Done([Move on])
  R -->|no| B
